{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は九十九里で撮影でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"海にも行ったし～\nプールにも入ったし～\nビーチサンダルはいたし～\n夏服きて～\nカンカン帽もかぶって～\n夏をたくさん感じられた撮影でした♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たのしかったな～♪\nたくさんふざけたの！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"カメラマンさんとアメトーーク‼︎の話しに\nなって、パクられ芸人の回の話しになって\nあるネタをずーっとやってたよ！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たぶんね、誌面には載らないだろうけど\nこの笑顔の写真はきっと\nそのネタをやる前後なんだろうな～\nってわかるくらい笑いました！！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、新しい私を見ていただけると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさん是非見て下さいね♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また、告知してよくなったらします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちょっとふざけようとする前の顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"時々する真面目な顔"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はすごーーーーく暑かったですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"太陽の光が地面にあたって\n地面がジリジリ音がなってるのが\n聞こえるくらい暑かった！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そんな中、地面にでてきてしまった\nミミズが可哀想で\nスタッフさんに救助してもらったよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"無事に、日陰のジメジメしたところに\n移動できてよかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"九十九里で海の方だったからか\nお家の周りではなかなかみない大きさで\nちょっとゾワゾワ～としたけど\n足がいっぱいある虫より\nミミズの方が苦手じゃない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うん、虫が苦手な方\nたくさんいらっしゃると思うから\n虫の話しはここまでにしよう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"虫が苦手な方は\n今までの話し\n無視(虫)してください(*´꒳`*)！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おそろっち！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張り屋さんです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私たちは同じ景色をみることを\n目指してると思う！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばろう！ね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"らんちゃんだいすき！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/07/08/3800854/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、今日はこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}